---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
---
<section class="scroll-story-section section-pad" data-scroll-story>
  <div class="scroll-story-heading">
    <span class="eyebrow">THE ARCHITECTURE OF TABS</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">One window.<br /><em>Every project.</em></h2>
  </div>

  <div class="scroll-story-grid">
    <div class="scroll-lines" data-scroll-lines>
      <div class="scroll-line highlighted" data-line="1">
        Building real software isn't just a <em>chatbot prompt.</em>
      </div>
      <div class="scroll-line" data-line="2">
        You need your <em>Code OSS editor</em>, terminal servers, Git diffs, and live browser previews.
      </div>
      <div class="scroll-line" data-line="3">
        And you never work on just <em>one project</em> at a single stretch.
      </div>
      <div class="scroll-line" data-line="4">
        Tabs turns each codebase into a <em>browser-like tab</em> at the top.
      </div>
      <div class="scroll-line" data-line="5">
        Switch entire repositories, server processes, and agent threads in <em>a single click.</em>
      </div>
      <div class="scroll-line" data-line="6">
        No frantic desktop swiping. No window clutter. <em>Bigger than an IDE.</em>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="showcase-sticky-wrap">
      <div class="mock-tabs-window" data-tabs-mock>
        <div class="mock-titlebar">
          <div class="mock-traffic-lights" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="light red"></span>
            <span class="light yellow"></span>
            <span class="light green"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-tabs-rail" role="tablist" aria-label="Project tabs">
            <button type="button" role="tab" class="mock-tab active" data-proj="throttle" aria-selected="true">
              <span>ThrottleClan</span>
              <span class="mock-tab-close" aria-hidden="true">✕</span>
            </button>
            <button type="button" role="tab" class="mock-tab" data-proj="intern" aria-selected="false">
              <span>intern-batch-08</span>
              <span class="mock-tab-close" aria-hidden="true">✕</span>
            </button>
            <button type="button" role="tab" class="mock-tab" data-proj="api" aria-selected="false">
              <span>payment-api</span>
              <span class="mock-tab-close" aria-hidden="true">✕</span>
            </button>
            <button type="button" class="mock-tab-add" aria-label="Open new project tab">+</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mock-toolbar">
          <div class="mock-tool-chips" role="tablist" aria-label="IDE Tools">
            <button type="button" class="tool-chip active" data-tool-btn="agents" aria-selected="true"><Icon name="Bot" size={13} /> Agents</button>
            <button type="button" class="tool-chip" data-tool-btn="code" aria-selected="false"><Icon name="Code2" size={13} /> Code</button>
            <button type="button" class="tool-chip" data-tool-btn="server" aria-selected="false"><Icon name="Rocket" size={13} /> Launchpad</button>
            <button type="button" class="tool-chip" data-tool-btn="git" aria-selected="false"><Icon name="GitBranch" size={13} /> Git</button>
            <button type="button" class="tool-chip" data-tool-btn="browser" aria-selected="false"><Icon name="Globe" size={13} /> Browser</button>
            <button type="button" class="tool-chip" data-tool-btn="testing" aria-selected="false"><Icon name="CheckCircle" size={13} /> Testing</button>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-actions">
            <span class="nav-arrow">←</span>
            <span class="nav-arrow">→</span>
            <span class="nav-reload">↻</span>
            <span class="settings-chip">⚙ Settings</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mock-stage">
          <div class="mock-meta-row">
            <span class="badge repo" data-proj-meta="repo">~/dev/throttle-clan</span>
            <span class="badge git-branch" data-proj-meta="branch">feature/checkout</span>
            <span class="badge server" data-proj-meta="server">port: 3000 (Vite)</span>
          </div>

          <!-- 1. AGENTS VIEW -->
          <div class="mock-tool-view" data-tool-view="agents">
            <div class="agents-panel">
              <div class="agent-cockpit-bar">
                <div class="agent-model-select">
                  <Icon name="Bot" size={14} />
                  <strong>Codex (o3-mini)</strong>
                  <span class="agent-driver-tag">ACP Driver</span>
                </div>
                <div class="agent-reasoning-pill">
                  <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
                  <span>Reasoning: MAX</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="agent-messages-container">
                <div class="agent-chat-msg user">
                  <div class="msg-author">You</div>
                  <div class="msg-bubble">
                    Refactor checkout middleware to support idempotent webhook retries and verify test coverage.
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="agent-thinking-pill">
                  <span class="spark">✦</span>
                  <span>Reasoned for 3.2s · Inspected 4 payment modules in codebase</span>
                </div>

                <div class="agent-chat-msg bot">
                  <div class="msg-author bot">Codex</div>
                  <div class="msg-bubble bot">
                    <p>I've implemented the idempotency check in <code>CheckoutSession.ts</code> using Redis locks, and added an automated Playwright regression suite.</p>
                    <div class="inline-diff-card">
                      <div class="diff-card-head">
                        <span class="tag-diff">[DIFF]</span>
                        <strong>src/services/CheckoutSession.ts</strong>
                        <span class="diff-stat">+24 -6</span>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="agent-composer-mock">
                <div class="composer-mock-input">
                  <span>Ask anything, @tag files, or run /tools...</span>
                </div>
                <div class="composer-mock-bottom">
                  <div class="composer-mock-chips">
                    <span class="chip-model">GPT-5.6-Sol · MAX</span>
                    <span class="chip-access">Full Access</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="composer-send-arrow">↑</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 2. CODE VIEW -->
          <div class="mock-tool-view" data-tool-view="code" hidden>
            <div class="code-panel">
              <div class="code-tabs-strip">
                <div class="code-editor-tab active">
                  <span class="file-badge ts">TS</span>
                  <span>CheckoutSession.ts</span>
                  <span class="tab-close">✕</span>
                </div>
                <div class="code-editor-tab">
                  <span class="file-badge tsx">TSX</span>
                  <span>App.tsx</span>
                </div>
                <div class="code-editor-tab">
                  <span class="file-badge config">⚙</span>
                  <span>vite.config.ts</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="code-breadcrumbs-bar">
                src <span>›</span> services <span>›</span> payments <span>›</span> <strong>CheckoutSession.ts</strong> <span>›</span> processOrder()
              </div>
              <div class="code-editor-canvas">
                <div class="editor-gutter">
                  <span>1</span><span>2</span><span>3</span><span>4</span><span>5</span><span>6</span><span>7</span><span>8</span><span>9</span><span>10</span><span>11</span><span>12</span><span>13</span><span>14</span>
                </div>
                <pre class="editor-code-lines"><code><span class="tok-kw">import</span> &#123; Effect, Schema &#125; <span class="tok-kw">from</span> <span class="tok-str">"effect"</span>;
<span class="tok-kw">import</span> &#123; redis &#125; <span class="tok-kw">from</span> <span class="tok-str">"../infra/redis"</span>;
<span class="tok-kw">import type</span> &#123; PaymentIntent, OrderReceipt &#125; <span class="tok-kw">from</span> <span class="tok-str">"./types"</span>;

<span class="tok-kw">export const</span> <span class="tok-fn">processOrder</span> = (orderId: <span class="tok-type">string</span>, idempotencyKey: <span class="tok-type">string</span>) =&gt;
  Effect.gen(<span class="tok-kw">function*</span> () &#123;
    <span class="tok-kw">const</span> lock = <span class="tok-kw">yield*</span> redis.<span class="tok-fn">acquireLock</span>(<span class="tok-str">`order:$&#123;idempotencyKey&#125;`</span>, 10_000);
    <span class="tok-kw">const</span> intent = <span class="tok-kw">yield*</span> <span class="tok-fn">createPaymentIntent</span>(orderId);
    <span class="tok-kw">yield*</span> <span class="tok-fn">verifyInventory</span>(intent.items);
    <span class="tok-kw">const</span> charged = <span class="tok-kw">yield*</span> <span class="tok-fn">executeCharge</span>(intent.amount);
    <span class="tok-kw">yield*</span> lock.<span class="tok-fn">release</span>();
    
    <span class="tok-cmt">// Idempotency token verified via Redis locks</span>
    <span class="tok-kw">return</span> &#123; success: <span class="tok-kw">true</span>, tx: charged.id, orderId &#125;;
  &#125;).pipe(Effect.<span class="tok-fn">catchTag</span>(<span class="tok-str">"LockTimeout"</span>, () =&gt; Effect.<span class="tok-fn">fail</span>(<span class="tok-str">"Concurrent request"</span>)));</code></pre>
              </div>
              <div class="editor-statusbar">
                <span>Ln 11, Col 28</span>
                <span>UTF-8</span>
                <span>TypeScript 5.8</span>
                <span>Git: +24 -6</span>
                <span class="status-clean">✓ 0 Errors</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 3. SERVER VIEW -->
          <div class="mock-tool-view" data-tool-view="server" hidden>
            <div class="server-panel">
              <div class="server-tabs-bar">
                <span class="server-terminal-tab active">&gt;_ vite dev (port 3000)</span>
                <span class="server-terminal-tab">&gt;_ redis-server</span>
                <span class="server-terminal-tab">&gt;_ worker:payments</span>
              </div>
              <div class="server-terminal-body">
                <div class="term-row cmd"><span class="term-p">$</span> bun run dev:desktop</div>
                <div class="term-row ok">  VITE v6.1.2  ready in 184 ms</div>
                <div class="term-row empty"></div>
                <div class="term-row">  ➜  <span class="term-hl">Local:</span>   <span class="term-link" data-server-link>http://localhost:3000/</span></div>
                <div class="term-row">  ➜  <span class="term-hl">Network:</span> <span class="term-link">http://192.168.1.42:3000/</span></div>
                <div class="term-row dim">  ➜  press h + enter to show help</div>
                <div class="term-row empty"></div>
                <div class="term-row info">[tabs-acp] provider session connected (codex-o3-mini)</div>
                <div class="term-row info">[vite] hmr update /src/services/CheckoutSession.ts (x2)</div>
                <div class="term-row ok-log"><span class="code-badge">200 OK</span> GET /api/v1/health 1.4ms</div>
                <div class="term-row ok-log"><span class="code-badge">200 OK</span> POST /api/v1/checkout/session 14.8ms</div>
                <div class="term-row dim">[redis] key lock:order:idemp_892 expired gracefully</div>
                <div class="term-row input-prompt"><span class="term-p">$</span> <span class="term-cursor">█</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="server-metrics-bar">
                <span>CPU: 1.4%</span>
                <span>MEM: 84.2 MB</span>
                <span>HMR: Active</span>
                <span class="pill-up">● UP 18m</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 4. GIT VIEW -->
          <div class="mock-tool-view" data-tool-view="git" hidden>
            <div class="git-panel">
              <div class="git-top-summary">
                <div class="git-branch-tag">
                  <Icon name="GitBranch" size={13} />
                  <strong data-git-branch-display>feature/checkout</strong>
                  <span class="diff-numbers">+24 / -6</span>
                </div>
                <span class="staged-count-pill">3 Staged Files</span>
              </div>
              <div class="git-files-list">
                <div class="git-file staged">
                  <span class="git-badge m">M</span>
                  <span class="file-path">src/services/CheckoutSession.ts</span>
                  <span class="file-stat">+18 -4</span>
                </div>
                <div class="git-file staged">
                  <span class="git-badge a">A</span>
                  <span class="file-path">tests/checkout.spec.ts</span>
                  <span class="file-stat">+6 -0</span>
                </div>
                <div class="git-file staged">
                  <span class="git-badge m">M</span>
                  <span class="file-path">src/infra/redis.ts</span>
                  <span class="file-stat">+2 -2</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="git-diff-box">
                <div class="diff-header-line">@@ -14,7 +14,10 @@ export const handleWebhook = async (req) =&gt; &#123;</div>
                <div class="diff-row del"><span class="sign">-</span>  const session = await findSession(req.body.id);</div>
                <div class="diff-row add"><span class="sign">+</span>  const token = req.headers["x-idempotency-key"];</div>
                <div class="diff-row add"><span class="sign">+</span>  const session = await findOrCreateSession(token);</div>
                <div class="diff-row add"><span class="sign">+</span>  await redis.set(`session:$&#123;token&#125;`, "DONE", "EX", 86400);</div>
                <div class="diff-row ctx"><span class="sign"> </span>  return &#123; status: "success", session &#125;;</div>
              </div>
              <div class="git-commit-strip">
                <span class="commit-placeholder">fix(checkout): enforce idempotency key on webhooks</span>
                <button type="button" class="btn-mock-commit">Commit &amp; Push ↗</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 5. BROWSER VIEW -->
          <div class="mock-tool-view" data-tool-view="browser" hidden>
            <div class="browser-panel">
              <div class="browser-url-strip">
                <div class="nav-arrows"><span>←</span><span>→</span><span>↻</span></div>
                <div class="url-input-box">
                  <span class="lock-icon">🔒</span>
                  <span class="url-address" data-browser-url>http://localhost:3000/checkout</span>
                  <span class="url-status-tag">200 OK</span>
                </div>
                <div class="viewport-toggle">
                  <span class="vp-chip active">Desktop</span>
                  <span class="vp-chip">Mobile</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="browser-canvas-area">
                <div class="web-preview-store">
                  <div class="preview-navbar">
                    <span class="brand-text">ThrottleClan Store</span>
                    <span class="cart-pill">Cart (1)</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="preview-hero-card">
                    <div class="product-thumb"></div>
                    <div class="product-info">
                      <h4>Carbon Aero Handlebars</h4>
                      <p>$320.00 · In Stock (Express Shipping)</p>
                      <div class="preview-success-badge">Order Processed Successfully ✓</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="preview-details-row">
                    <div class="detail-item">
                      <span class="detail-lbl">Idempotency Key:</span>
                      <span class="detail-val">idemp_live_89bf2a</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="detail-item">
                      <span class="detail-lbl">Payment Status:</span>
                      <span class="detail-val text-green">Captured ($320.00)</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="preview-hmr-bubble">
                    <span>⚡ Fast Refresh Connected · 0 Errors</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 6. TESTING VIEW -->
          <div class="mock-tool-view" data-tool-view="testing" hidden>
            <div class="testing-panel">
              <div class="testing-top-bar">
                <div class="testing-title-pill">
                  <Icon name="CheckCircle" size={14} />
                  <strong>Playwright Test Suite</strong>
                  <span class="test-pass-count">8 / 8 Passed</span>
                </div>
                <span class="test-duration">1.24s</span>
              </div>
              <div class="testing-specs-list">
                <div class="test-row pass">
                  <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
                  <span class="spec-desc">checkout.spec.ts &gt; idempotency token prevents double charge</span>
                  <span class="spec-time">142ms</span>
                </div>
                <div class="test-row pass">
                  <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
                  <span class="spec-desc">checkout.spec.ts &gt; recovers gracefully from network timeout</span>
                  <span class="spec-time">88ms</span>
                </div>
                <div class="test-row pass">
                  <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
                  <span class="spec-desc">auth.spec.ts &gt; refreshes expired ACP session tokens</span>
                  <span class="spec-time">210ms</span>
                </div>
                <div class="test-row pass">
                  <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
                  <span class="spec-desc">visual-regression &gt; payment success dialog matches baseline</span>
                  <span class="spec-time">305ms</span>
                </div>
                <div class="test-row pass">
                  <span class="check-icon">✓</span>
                  <span class="spec-desc">redis-lock.spec.ts &gt; auto-releases lock after transaction commits</span>
                  <span class="spec-time">94ms</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="testing-footer-bar">
                <div class="test-meter-track">
                  <div class="test-meter-fill"></div>
                </div>
                <div class="test-meter-labels">
                  <span>100% Passing · All assertions verified</span>
                  <strong>Zero Flakiness</strong>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mock-footer">
          <span>Click any project tab above to switch codebases instantly.</span>
          <strong>1 Window · 6 Tools · 0 Clutter</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>

<style>
  .scroll-story-section {
    padding: 90px 6%;
    border-top: 1px solid #1d25b925;
    background: #eff0e8;
    color: #1d25b9;
  }
  .scroll-story-heading {
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(45px, 6.5vw, 88px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    margin: 15px 0 0;
  }
  .section-title em {
    font-style: normal;
    background: #e8ff73;
    padding: 0 10px;
    display: inline-block;
    transform: rotate(-2deg);
  }
  .scroll-story-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 1fr;
    gap: 50px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .scroll-lines {
    padding-top: 20px;
    padding-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .scroll-line {
    font-family: "Space Grotesk", sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 42px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: #1d25b9;
    opacity: 0.22;
    transform: translateY(8px);
    transition: opacity 0.35s ease, transform 0.35s ease, color 0.35s ease;
    margin-bottom: 42px;
    cursor: pointer;
    user-select: none;
  }
  .scroll-line:hover {
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  .scroll-line.highlighted {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
  .scroll-line em {
    font-style: normal;
    background: #e8ff73;
    color: #1d25b9;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: inline-block;
    transform: rotate(-1.5deg);
    transition: background 0.3s ease;
  }
  .scroll-line:nth-child(even) em {
    background: #ecb3ce;
    transform: rotate(1deg);
  }
  .scroll-line:nth-child(3n) em {
    background: #d4d3f8;
    transform: rotate(-1deg);
  }

  /* Mock Tabs Window Showcase */
  .showcase-sticky-wrap {
    position: sticky;
    top: 90px;
  }
  .mock-tabs-window {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 2px solid #1d25b9;
    border-radius: 14px;
    box-shadow: 8px 10px 0 #172294;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .mock-titlebar {
    background: #e2e4d9;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1d25b940;
    padding: 8px 12px 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .mock-traffic-lights {
    display: flex;
    gap: 5px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .light {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }
  .light.red { background: #ff5f56; }
  .light.yellow { background: #ffbd2e; }
  .light.green { background: #27c93f; }
  .mock-tabs-rail {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 4px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .mock-tab {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    background: #d5d8cc;
    color: #555;
    border: 1px solid #1d25b930;
    border-bottom: 0;
    border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .mock-tab:hover {
    background: #eceee5;
    color: #1d25b9;
  }
  .mock-tab.active {
    background: #ffffff;
    color: #1d25b9;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-color: #1d25b9;
  }
  .mock-tab-close {
    font-size: 9px;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  .mock-tab-add {
    background: transparent;
    border: 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #1d25b9;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
  }
  .mock-toolbar {
    background: #f7f8f4;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1d25b920;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .mock-tool-chips {
    display: flex;
    gap: 5px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .tool-chip {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    background: #eef0e8;
    color: #555;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }
  .tool-chip:hover {
    background: #e2e5d9;
    color: #1d25b9;
  }
  .tool-chip.active {
    background: #1d25b9;
    color: #f4ff82;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-color: #1d25b9;
  }
  .mock-actions {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: #777;
  }
  .nav-arrow, .nav-reload {
    cursor: default;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  .settings-chip {
    font-size: 9px;
    background: #e9ebd9;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    color: #333;
  }
  .mock-stage {
    padding: 14px;
    min-height: 520px;
    height: 520px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .mock-meta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .badge {
    font-family: monospace;
